onFrameHost_xER0IBnB21.png", "id": "1103674041365865", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001719_1103674044699198_837765276882608355_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_D--0z36i0YQ7kNvwHwR1fG&_nc_oc=AdkExWo84vye4c70bloC9mBzkAkAnQhefD8ySJic6V6TBE7x1xfAHcIqPzYV_8rnawI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsDQyLm44mCypVFuiClod-yUpNTjWHa_aM1tEFSc3bydQ&oe=699C53D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Laboratory Safety Training_Landscape.png", "id": "670218148403280", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974920_670218155069946_1643766435637563529_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CQdnu8WN-4UQ7kNvwE7JUbD&_nc_oc=AdmOAtoZAxzvLeunS6ddPqbSOlQ7Ln8Ba9CQNR1q4EJKbuN0l0bkWqQSxWP4ultd50M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftqocEvGo-Jj_OPGF00Qhww9IUQWS7Sjd9Xync03ZXGLA&oe=699C615C"}, "display_name": "Laboratory Safety Training- ContentsDa", "keywords": ["safety", "laboratory", "accident", "simulation", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. Prepare for lab safety incidents: Put on safety equipment before your experiment. Wear safety glasses and a lab coat.\n2. How to operate an alkaline lamp: Find the alkaline lamp and igniter, place it on the white table, and flick the flame to experience fire.\n3. burn treatment: soak the burned area in water to reduce the heat and wrap it with clean gauze.\n4. Staunching wounds: Use clean gauze to staunch bleeding if a tool breaks during the experiment.\n5. organize experimental tools: put the alcohol lamp in the display case after the experiment is finished.\n6. fire response: If a fire occurs, use the fire extinguisher near the door to extinguish the fire.", "short_description": "Master the essential safety protocols for working in a laboratory. This training covers proper handling of chemicals, equipment use, and emergency procedures, ensuring a safe and informed lab environment."}]}, "developer_name"